- `Cmd+L` (Mac) / `Ctrl+L` (Windows/Linux) - Open Continue chat - `Cmd+I` (Mac) / `Ctrl+I` (Windows/Linux) - Inline edit - `Cmd+Shift+R` (Mac) / `Ctrl+Shift+R` (Windows/Linux) - Regenerate response
