## Best Practices
### Model Selection Strategy - **Quick edits**: Use `cc/claude-haiku-4-20250514` - **Code generation**: Use `cx/deepseek-chat` - **Complex refactoring**: Use `cc/claude-opus-4-5-20251101` - **Problem solving**: Use `cx/deepseek-reasoner`
### Context Management - Select only relevant code before asking - Use specific, clear prompts - Break complex tasks into smaller steps
