``` Provider: OpenAI Compatible Base URL: http://localhost:20128/v1 API Key: [from dashboard] Model: cc/claude-opus-4-5-20251101 ```
### Codex CLI
```bash export OPENAI_BASE_URL="http://localhost:20128" export OPENAI_API_KEY="your-9router-api-key"
codex "your prompt" ```
