**Opción 2 — Manual:** Edita `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`:
```json { "agents": { "defaults": { "model": { "primary": "9router/kr/claude-sonnet-4.5" } } }, "models": { "providers": { "9router": { "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1", "apiKey": "sk_9router", "api": "openai-completions", "models": [ { "id": "kr/claude-sonnet-4.5", "name": "Claude Sonnet 4.5 (Kiro Free)" } ] } } } } ```
> **Nota:** OpenClaw solo funciona con 9Router local. Usa `127.0.0.1` en lugar de `localhost` para evitar problemas de resolución IPv6.
