## How to use
Paste to your AI (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT, …):
``` Read this skill and use it: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/decolua/9router/refs/heads/master/skills/9router/SKILL.md ```
Then ask normally — *"generate an image of a cat"*, *"transcribe this URL"*, etc.
## Configure your shell once
```bash export NINEROUTER_URL="http://localhost:20128" # local default, or your VPS / tunnel URL export NINEROUTER_KEY="sk-..." # from Dashboard → Keys (only if requireApiKey=true) ```
Verify: `curl $NINEROUTER_URL/api/health` → `{"ok":true}`.
